<title>USA: Capitol Bancorp sets stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Capitol Bancorp sets stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>LANSING, Mich. 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Capitol Bancorp Ltd said on Wednesday it will pay a stock dividend of one share for every 10 held by shareholders.</p>
<p>The dividend will be paid on December 31 to shareholders of record December 2.</p>
</text>
